---
import PhoneFrame from './PhoneFrame.astro';
import RadarMockCard from './RadarMockCard.astro';
import { RADAR } from '../../lib/radar';
import { url } from '../../lib/url';
---

<section class="radar-band">
  <div class="container radar-band-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="radar-kicker">增量 · {RADAR.name} {RADAR.version}</p>
      <h2>群消息很多，<br />重要的只有几条。</h2>
      <p class="radar-lede">
        把班级群、学院群、社团群的通知变成待办：谁发的、什么时候截止、原文在哪。你自己跑，数据只留在本机。
      </p>

      <ul class="radar-points">
        <li>
          <strong>只读群消息</strong>
          <span>白名单 5–10 个群，不发言、不拉人</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>截止前 7-3-1 天</strong>
          <span>待办按紧迫度浮上来，不再刷屏</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>数据只在本机</strong>
          <span>SQLite 本地存储，不上传服务器</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Windows 双击即用</strong>
          <span>浏览器打开 127.0.0.1，无需部署</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="radar-band-actions">
        <a class="btn" href={url('/radar#demo')}>看界面演示</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href={url('/radar#install')}>三步安装</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="radar-stage">
      <PhoneFrame small>
        <RadarMockCard />
      </PhoneFrame>
      <p class="radar-caption">
        界面示意 · 演示数据均为虚构 ·
        <a href={url('/radar/demo')}>打开可交互演示 →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
